@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统 状态图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #555555
    ArrowColor #333333
    FontColor #222222
}
hide empty description
state "待支付\nCREATED" as Created
state "已支付\nPAID" as Paid
state "已接单\nACCEPTED" as Accepted
state "配送中\nDELIVERING" as Delivering
state "已送达\nDELIVERED" as Delivered
state "已完成\nCOMPLETED" as Completed
state "已取消\nCANCELLED" as Cancelled
state "已拒单\nREJECTED" as Rejected
state "已退款\nREFUNDED" as Refunded
state "配送失败\nDELIVERY_FAILED" as DeliveryFailed
[*] --> Created : 提交订单
Created --> Paid : 支付成功
Created --> Cancelled : 15 分钟内取消\n/ 支付超时
Paid --> Accepted : 商家接单
Paid --> Rejected : 商家拒单（填写说明）
Paid --> Cancelled : 接单超时自动取消\n/ 扣除信誉分
Accepted --> Delivering : 登记出餐并分配配送员
Delivering --> Delivered : 配送员确认送达
Delivering --> DeliveryFailed : 无法联系顾客\n/ 拍照留证
Delivered --> Completed : 顾客确认\n/ 2 小时自动确认
Rejected --> Refunded : 自动退款
Cancelled --> Refunded : 已支付金额原路退回
Cancelled --> [*] : 未支付关闭
DeliveryFailed --> Refunded : 管理员审核后退款\n（规则待确认）
Completed --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
note top of Paid
  支付成功后才允许进入
  商家接单流程（REQ-016）。
end note
note right of Completed
  已完成订单不可取消；
  出现问题只能向平台申诉（REQ-025）。
end note
note left of Cancelled
  已取消订单不能再次接单（REQ-025）。
end note
note bottom of Delivered
  配送员确认送达后 2 小时，
  顾客未确认则系统自动确认（REQ-021）。
end note
note bottom of DeliveryFailed
  配送失败属于订单主状态；
  后续处理由管理员介入审核（REQ-020/022）。
end note
@enduml